OL,3,GNEWSAThe Arsenal star's mum helping
OL,4,Afootball's newest recruits
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarcia Lewis was new to football when
OL,7,Fher son, Myles Lewis-Skelly, joined
OL,8,FArsenal's football academy at the age
OL,9,Fof eight.
OL,11,FFast forward to today, and Lewis-Skelly
OL,12,Fis playing regularly for Arsenal and
OL,13,Fhas been selected for England.
OL,15,FIn March last year, at the age of 18,
OL,16,Fhe made football history when he became
OL,17,Fthe youngest player to score on debut
OL,18,Ffor the men's senior national team.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
