OL,3,GNEWSAThe Arsenal star's mum helping
OL,4,Afootball's newest recruits
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been quite the journey, from a
OL,7,Fyoung academy player to a professional
OL,8,Ffootballer - and not always an easy
OL,9,Fone, according to his mum. She said the
OL,10,Ffamily were suddenly in an environment
OL,11,Fthat was "quite foreign".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
